maps to coin collection maps to reward
learned causal

125
00:08:05,079 --> 00:08:09,319
structure action maps to rightward
movement maps to reward.

126
00:08:09,800 --> 00:08:13,819
Both structures explain the training data
equally well. Standard

127
00:08:13,819 --> 00:08:19,019
reinforcement learning algorithms optimize
for expected return without explicitly

128
00:08:19,019 --> 00:08:22,860
performing causal discovery. They increase
the probability of reward

129
00:08:22,860 --> 00:08:26,699
